1
00:00:00,041 --> 00:00:01,499
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,041
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,290 --> 00:00:04,290
(Episode 68)

4
00:00:04,291 --> 00:00:08,500
Ji Hu, were you begging her to stay
even after she treated you like that?

5
00:00:09,250 --> 00:00:10,375
Why should you?

6
00:00:10,416 --> 00:00:13,833
You were even willing to die for Ji Ni.
Why should you put up with this?

7
00:00:23,129 --> 00:00:26,583
I can't just let this woman
get away with it.

8
00:00:26,708 --> 00:00:28,291
Please, just stop.

9
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:30,642
You humiliated and hit Ji Ni, Mom.

10
00:00:31,375 --> 00:00:35,152
Do Hee tried to run Ji Ni over
just because I like her.

11
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:40,921
I'm the reason this happened.
I'm the one who loves her.

12
00:00:41,375 --> 00:00:45,458
I jumped in front of the car for Ji Ni.
I'm not asking for praise.

13
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:48,833
That doesn't mean
my son should have to beg like this.

14
00:00:49,083 --> 00:00:53,291
What's so special about her?
What are you lacking?

15
00:00:53,458 --> 00:00:54,500
Let's go...

16
00:00:56,791 --> 00:00:58,791
- Ma'am.
- I came to make sure you ate well,

17
00:01:00,416 --> 00:01:03,875
since you've had nothing but trouble
ever since you got out of the hospital.

18
00:01:04,041 --> 00:01:06,958
But I never thought I'd walk in on this.

19
00:01:08,041 --> 00:01:10,507
Thank you. Please go home.

20
00:01:10,666 --> 00:01:13,958
Ji Hu, I need to talk to you.

21
00:01:15,125 --> 00:01:16,800
I know what you came to say.

22
00:01:17,333 --> 00:01:20,166
I'll handle it myself. Please go home.

23
00:01:20,250 --> 00:01:21,291
Ji Hu.

24
00:01:43,666 --> 00:01:46,991
I can't let this go. This is unacceptable.

25
00:01:47,125 --> 00:01:50,375
If I hadn't seen it, that'd be one thing.
But now I can't just let it go.

26
00:01:50,416 --> 00:01:53,604
- Mom.
- She should be the one begging,

27
00:01:53,791 --> 00:01:56,541
but seeing you beg her too?
I can't stand it.

28
00:01:56,583 --> 00:01:58,761
Just thinking about you calling
a woman like that your mother-in-law...

29
00:01:58,763 --> 00:02:00,583
makes my blood boil.

30
00:02:00,865 --> 00:02:04,281
Do you think I raised you
to be treated like this?

31
00:02:04,333 --> 00:02:05,791
How did you raise me, then?

32
00:02:06,083 --> 00:02:09,958
I'm your trophy son, aren't I?

33
00:02:11,333 --> 00:02:13,714
Though I stopped being that
a long time ago.

34
00:02:15,041 --> 00:02:19,208
Ji Hu, why are you being so negative?

35
00:02:19,875 --> 00:02:21,789
You've changed since the accident.

36
00:02:21,791 --> 00:02:26,497
It's all because of that Ji Ni girl,
isn't it?

37
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,952
I've done everything I could for you.

38
00:02:29,791 --> 00:02:31,708
You're all I have.

39
00:02:32,115 --> 00:02:33,359
Do you know what?

40
00:02:33,999 --> 00:02:36,375
You and Do Hee have a lot in common.

41
00:02:36,833 --> 00:02:38,970
- What did you say?
- Both Do Hee and you...

42
00:02:39,125 --> 00:02:42,939
say you love me,
but neither of you cares what I want.

43
00:02:43,375 --> 00:02:45,333
Why do you do this if you really love me?

44
00:02:46,585 --> 00:02:48,126
Enough. Let's stop talking.

45
00:02:48,335 --> 00:02:51,460
You ungrateful brat! You...

46
00:02:52,166 --> 00:02:55,250
You've been hanging around Ji Ni,
and now you're acting strange.

47
00:02:55,704 --> 00:02:59,916
You need to be hospitalized again.
You're not yourself anymore.

48
00:03:02,255 --> 00:03:04,172
I used to give up on everything.

49
00:03:05,018 --> 00:03:06,934
I did whatever you wanted.

50
00:03:08,083 --> 00:03:09,291
But not anymore.

51
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:13,375
Loving Ji Ni helped me
understand who I really am.

52
00:03:13,541 --> 00:03:15,344
So Na Ji Ni is a monster to you.

53
00:03:16,375 --> 00:03:17,657
Do Hee was right.

54
00:03:27,250 --> 00:03:28,665
(Evidence Audio File)

55
00:03:28,666 --> 00:03:31,541
- Register your marriage?
- He'll get a work visa,

56
00:03:31,625 --> 00:03:34,230
and I can go with him as his spouse.

57
00:03:34,333 --> 00:03:36,202
Now that I'm married,

58
00:03:36,412 --> 00:03:39,208
I can't keep relying on my dad
to protect me forever.

59
00:03:39,666 --> 00:03:42,164
- My mom thinks it's a good idea too.
- I see.

60
00:03:42,833 --> 00:03:45,670
You've already got things set up
in London. What is there to worry about?

61
00:03:46,416 --> 00:03:49,375
Right?
You and I really are on the same page.

62
00:03:49,500 --> 00:03:52,148
We booked the wedding venue last night.

63
00:03:52,375 --> 00:03:55,070
Someone had just canceled,
so we grabbed the spot.

64
00:03:55,293 --> 00:03:58,536
This one is my mother-in-law.
There's one of Ji Hu saying to do it too.

65
00:03:59,083 --> 00:04:02,083
I couldn't bring that with me.
And this is...

66
00:04:03,416 --> 00:04:04,528
the wedding invitation.

67
00:04:07,791 --> 00:04:09,521
So you were clearly planning
to get married soon.

68
00:04:10,250 --> 00:04:11,636
Did you register your marriage
in advance too?

69
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,041
That's what I'm telling you.

70
00:04:13,166 --> 00:04:15,416
The most important thing
is what the people getting married say.

71
00:04:15,541 --> 00:04:17,041
You need to prepare carefully.

72
00:04:17,666 --> 00:04:18,802
Okay.

73
00:04:19,416 --> 00:04:22,666
With all this, there shouldn't be
any grounds to annul the marriage, right?

74
00:04:22,708 --> 00:04:23,958
I'll do everything I can.

75
00:04:24,458 --> 00:04:27,551
But given that your husband, Im Ji Hu,

76
00:04:27,552 --> 00:04:29,375
reportedly had mental health issues,

77
00:04:29,583 --> 00:04:30,916
we need to plan our strategy around that.

78
00:04:30,958 --> 00:04:32,770
That's the most frustrating part.

79
00:04:33,191 --> 00:04:35,691
How can we know
if he actually remembers or not?

80
00:04:35,916 --> 00:04:38,125
If he says he doesn't,
that's what they'll go with.

81
00:04:38,166 --> 00:04:41,458
He was the one who asked me to marry him.
That's why we went through with it.

82
00:04:42,756 --> 00:04:44,308
Is there any other evidence?

83
00:04:44,967 --> 00:04:49,374
In England, our families had agreed,
so we were practically engaged.

84
00:04:50,666 --> 00:04:52,054
I can prove it.

85
00:04:52,125 --> 00:04:54,822
I can contact all the friends
I was close to back then.

86
00:04:55,496 --> 00:04:58,248
It'd help to get written statements.
Please collect them.

87
00:04:59,416 --> 00:05:02,453
Even if...

88
00:05:02,512 --> 00:05:06,128
we lose, it'll still be on record, right?

89
00:05:06,416 --> 00:05:08,458
That Na Ji Ni stole my place.

90
00:05:08,500 --> 00:05:12,750
Divorce and annulment are recorded
differently in the family registry.

91
00:05:12,875 --> 00:05:14,541
So there won't be any record at all?

92
00:05:14,583 --> 00:05:18,583
A ruling that the marriage is invalid
doesn't mean the case never existed.

93
00:05:18,706 --> 00:05:22,831
But compared to a divorce, the record
and legal effects are different.

94
00:05:22,833 --> 00:05:25,672
Okay. I'm counting on you.

95
00:05:25,944 --> 00:05:28,473
I paid more upfront than you asked for.

96
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:30,041
Thank you.

97
00:05:30,083 --> 00:05:33,416
Well, I have an appointment,
so I'll get going.

98
00:05:34,211 --> 00:05:35,461
I'll be in touch.

99
00:05:44,333 --> 00:05:46,220
Do Do Hee is coming here?

100
00:05:46,958 --> 00:05:49,922
That crazy bitch is holding a get-together
to hand out wedding invitations.

101
00:05:50,333 --> 00:05:52,386
She wants me to make room for her.

102
00:05:52,916 --> 00:05:54,416
Since when do you need a reservation
at a cafe?

103
00:05:54,752 --> 00:05:57,086
She's trying to rub it in my face.

104
00:05:57,708 --> 00:06:01,583
Fine. Just let her show up.
I'll dump a ton of salt in her coffee.

105
00:06:03,625 --> 00:06:05,125
We're still going to hang out
after you get married, right?

106
00:06:05,166 --> 00:06:07,540
Of course! What kind of question is that?

107
00:06:07,541 --> 00:06:09,458
Girl, you're getting prettier by the day!

108
00:06:09,666 --> 00:06:10,916
I've always been pretty.

109
00:06:11,125 --> 00:06:14,125
Hey, do you guys remember Na Ji Ni?

110
00:06:14,500 --> 00:06:15,541
Na Ji Ni?

111
00:06:15,875 --> 00:06:18,532
The one whose mom
was supposedly a mistress?

112
00:06:19,333 --> 00:06:22,458
No way! Long time no see!

113
00:06:22,500 --> 00:06:25,958
Seriously, you people just say
whatever you want!

114
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:27,204
Have you been waiting for me?

115
00:06:30,673 --> 00:06:31,815
You girls should come too.

116
00:06:32,263 --> 00:06:34,839
You have to see me marry Ji Hu.

117
00:06:34,875 --> 00:06:37,250
You think that fake paperwork of yours
is actually going to hold up?

118
00:06:37,291 --> 00:06:40,083
Looks like it already has.

119
00:06:40,958 --> 00:06:42,323
Did they bully you?

120
00:06:42,500 --> 00:06:45,180
Yeah.
They refused to testify back then too.

121
00:06:51,291 --> 00:06:53,093
Na Ji Ni's got guts now.

122
00:06:53,791 --> 00:06:56,291
You were right. She's changed a lot.

123
00:06:57,833 --> 00:07:01,375
Hey, Na Ji Ni.

124
00:07:02,250 --> 00:07:04,416
Wait...

125
00:07:05,041 --> 00:07:09,034
You still think you're in high school?
Get a grip on reality.

126
00:07:09,247 --> 00:07:12,914
Hey, Na Ji Ni. They're here
to get invitations to my wedding.

127
00:07:12,916 --> 00:07:15,825
Sure, we were a little mean to you
back in school,

128
00:07:16,125 --> 00:07:18,249
but isn't this a bit much
for an old schoolmate?

129
00:07:18,250 --> 00:07:19,500
A little mean?

130
00:07:22,562 --> 00:07:24,520
You married into a prosecutor's family,
didn't you?

131
00:07:24,626 --> 00:07:26,543
Want me to stir up some trouble for you?

132
00:07:26,986 --> 00:07:28,653
I'm sure your in-laws would love that.

133
00:07:28,857 --> 00:07:30,441
Hey, what on earth are you talking about?

134
00:07:30,916 --> 00:07:34,375
Just because I spoke to you,
you think we're friends?

135
00:07:34,458 --> 00:07:35,967
That's right. We were never friends.

136
00:07:36,588 --> 00:07:38,052
Then why did you treat me that way?

137
00:07:39,722 --> 00:07:43,014
I heard you called Jung A my servant.

138
00:07:43,625 --> 00:07:45,350
You'd better watch your mouth.

139
00:07:45,666 --> 00:07:47,690
And you girls,
stop acting like her servants.

140
00:07:47,848 --> 00:07:50,432
I still have all the records
from my dad's trial.

141
00:07:50,583 --> 00:07:53,083
Whether I win or lose,
if I push to reopen the case,

142
00:07:53,682 --> 00:07:56,849
it's only a matter of time
before your in-laws find out.

143
00:07:57,076 --> 00:07:58,492
You crazy bitch!

144
00:07:59,787 --> 00:08:02,370
Good. Got you on camera.

145
00:08:03,791 --> 00:08:05,791
I'm posting this on social media as is.

146
00:08:06,083 --> 00:08:08,666
Hey, why on earth did you bring us here?

147
00:08:08,979 --> 00:08:11,937
She's such a pain. Come on, let's go.

148
00:08:41,941 --> 00:08:45,232
That's disgusting! Seriously!

149
00:09:07,375 --> 00:09:11,583
Who did that? Seriously!

150
00:09:14,291 --> 00:09:18,958
Looking for me?
I'm Jung A. I even spoke politely!

151
00:09:20,333 --> 00:09:21,541
You bitch.

152
00:09:23,208 --> 00:09:25,250
Open this.
Are you going to open it or not?

153
00:09:25,500 --> 00:09:28,750
Go ahead and call the cops.
I'm not scared at all.

154
00:09:28,791 --> 00:09:33,041
Do you get paid
to be Ji Ni's little servant?

155
00:09:33,250 --> 00:09:35,583
I'll pay you more. Come work for me.

156
00:09:35,666 --> 00:09:38,625
My cafe job is enough for me. I'll pass.

157
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:49,583
What about you?
Think you'll strike gold living like this?

158
00:09:49,708 --> 00:09:51,041
Why are you like this?

159
00:09:51,083 --> 00:09:54,250
Enough! Open it!

160
00:09:54,583 --> 00:09:58,750
Hey, somebody help me!

161
00:10:07,125 --> 00:10:11,333
Na Ji Ni, right? It was you, wasn't it?

162
00:10:11,413 --> 00:10:15,121
Feel wronged? Furious?
How do you think I felt?

163
00:10:15,916 --> 00:10:17,541
You crazy...

164
00:10:17,583 --> 00:10:20,291
You'd better be ready.
I'm taking this all the way.

165
00:10:28,833 --> 00:10:30,541
Seriously!

166
00:10:45,375 --> 00:10:47,290
Hey, Jeon Jung A!

167
00:10:47,291 --> 00:10:48,666
My goodness, is it raining outside?

168
00:10:48,750 --> 00:10:50,166
What on earth are you saying?

169
00:10:51,958 --> 00:10:55,742
Call me a servant one more time,
and I'll knock all your teeth out.

170
00:10:57,416 --> 00:10:59,409
What makes you so cocky?

171
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:03,512
Myself. Unlike you, I have no connections
and nobody backing me up.

172
00:11:03,583 --> 00:11:05,875
Want me to show you how scary
someone with nothing can be?

173
00:11:07,125 --> 00:11:10,208
No need. I already know.
Cockroaches are pretty hard to kill.

174
00:11:11,726 --> 00:11:14,226
Even if you do your very best,
I'm still getting married soon.

175
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:17,125
Luckily, Ji Hu's parents are on my side.

176
00:11:18,208 --> 00:11:22,958
Ji Ni's background is so disgraceful
that they chose me instead.

177
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:24,442
We'll sue you.

178
00:11:24,444 --> 00:11:28,653
Go for it. Give it your best shot.
Good luck!

179
00:11:29,916 --> 00:11:31,057
That woman...

180
00:11:32,135 --> 00:11:34,583
She's got nerves of steel,
I'll give her that.

181
00:11:39,500 --> 00:11:40,541
What's wrong with her?

182
00:11:41,291 --> 00:11:42,583
Do you know Do Hee?

183
00:11:42,791 --> 00:11:46,458
Well, she's kind of... like this.

184
00:11:46,500 --> 00:11:48,498
Right, so you do know her.

185
00:11:49,458 --> 00:11:51,791
Ji Ni has suffered so much
because of someone like her.

186
00:11:54,541 --> 00:11:55,583
Why are you here?

187
00:11:56,500 --> 00:11:58,333
I heard you're leasing out your shop.

188
00:11:58,375 --> 00:12:02,875
Are you interested?
That's amazing. You'll do great.

189
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:04,563
What makes you think so?

190
00:12:04,583 --> 00:12:06,125
You're more impressive than I am.

191
00:12:07,335 --> 00:12:10,001
Lots of customers come here
just to see me.

192
00:12:12,078 --> 00:12:14,828
You have such honest eyes.
That's almost disappointing.

193
00:12:18,333 --> 00:12:19,656
As for the contract terms...

194
00:12:21,333 --> 00:12:23,333
You can read through everything here.

195
00:12:23,375 --> 00:12:24,416
Okay.

196
00:12:28,041 --> 00:12:32,250
What? My mom was hitting him,
and his mom caught her?

197
00:12:33,583 --> 00:12:35,083
This is bad...

198
00:12:35,250 --> 00:12:37,897
I've never seen Ji Hu get that angry
with his mom.

199
00:12:38,375 --> 00:12:40,333
I wasn't sure whether to call you, but...

200
00:12:40,416 --> 00:12:42,040
I'm glad you did.

201
00:12:42,333 --> 00:12:44,090
Ji Hu probably won't tell me himself.

202
00:12:44,666 --> 00:12:47,125
Jung A and I were going to grab lunch,

203
00:12:47,166 --> 00:12:49,750
but Ji Hu said he'd come here,
so I'm waiting for him.

204
00:12:50,916 --> 00:12:54,498
Okay, Tae O. Thanks, as always.

205
00:13:07,291 --> 00:13:08,415
What is it?

206
00:13:10,375 --> 00:13:13,916
I'm enjoying the sight of the great Ji Ni
waiting for me.

207
00:13:15,750 --> 00:13:19,208
I never thought this day would come.
Maybe that accident was a good thing.

208
00:13:19,386 --> 00:13:20,803
Ji Hu.

209
00:13:20,958 --> 00:13:24,620
If it hadn't happened,
you'd still be saying you didn't love me.

210
00:13:24,875 --> 00:13:26,295
That would've been even worse.

211
00:13:29,333 --> 00:13:32,975
I heard my mom hit you.
Are you okay? Where did she hit you?

212
00:13:33,958 --> 00:13:37,166
I should've shut Geum Tae O up
before I left.

213
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:39,251
Did it upset you?

214
00:13:39,541 --> 00:13:40,583
No.

215
00:13:41,666 --> 00:13:44,203
I was sad because I could understand
how your mom felt.

216
00:13:45,166 --> 00:13:48,652
How much pain must she have been in
to come here and hit me?

217
00:13:50,242 --> 00:13:54,117
It means my situation
is the worst possible outcome for her.

218
00:13:55,625 --> 00:13:56,805
Ji Hu...

219
00:13:58,166 --> 00:14:01,500
I've made an appointment with a lawyer.
I sent the necessary documents ahead.

220
00:14:02,625 --> 00:14:04,298
I can get the paperwork sorted out.

221
00:14:04,367 --> 00:14:06,041
I won't let your mom down.

222
00:14:08,916 --> 00:14:11,092
Come on, eat up.
It's getting late for lunch.

223
00:14:12,791 --> 00:14:16,359
I almost cried when your mom hit me.

224
00:14:17,102 --> 00:14:19,202
I've wanted this love for so long,

225
00:14:19,956 --> 00:14:21,977
yet I put you through all this, Ji Ni.

226
00:14:22,826 --> 00:14:25,909
I'm sorry. I don't know how to apologize.

227
00:14:25,958 --> 00:14:28,629
It's not like you wanted
any of this to happen.

228
00:14:29,833 --> 00:14:31,953
I heard you stood up to your mom too.

229
00:14:32,291 --> 00:14:33,416
You shouldn't have.

230
00:14:33,666 --> 00:14:35,333
Geum Tae O, seriously...

231
00:14:36,389 --> 00:14:38,056
It's okay if my mom gets hurt.

232
00:14:38,250 --> 00:14:41,125
She tried to marry me off
when I had amnesia. She's like Do Hee.

233
00:14:41,291 --> 00:14:43,125
You really said that to her?

234
00:14:43,625 --> 00:14:44,625
Yeah.

235
00:14:44,833 --> 00:14:46,500
That must've hurt her.

236
00:14:46,666 --> 00:14:48,750
Not as much as your mom was hurt, though.

237
00:14:48,791 --> 00:14:50,541
It's okay if my mom gets hurt.

238
00:14:51,041 --> 00:14:53,916
She even nailed the door shut
to keep me from seeing you.

239
00:14:55,416 --> 00:14:58,958
If we'd only met back then,
things might've turned out differently.

240
00:15:01,611 --> 00:15:03,236
We're terrible children, aren't we?

241
00:15:04,708 --> 00:15:05,916
A little?

242
00:15:08,958 --> 00:15:12,041
I've reviewed the documents.
The medical report is sufficient too.

243
00:15:14,458 --> 00:15:16,791
But my parents gave their permission.

244
00:15:17,291 --> 00:15:20,333
As an adult,
marriage is your own decision.

245
00:15:20,416 --> 00:15:24,541
Your parents have no say in registering
your marriage. You're not a minor.

246
00:15:27,932 --> 00:15:30,557
You were suffering from amnesia
when the marriage was registered,

247
00:15:30,733 --> 00:15:34,025
and you objected to it
as soon as you regained your memory.

248
00:15:34,264 --> 00:15:36,764
You also had a serious falling-out
with your parents.

249
00:15:36,908 --> 00:15:39,366
And Do Do Hee caused the accident
that led to my amnesia.

250
00:15:42,847 --> 00:15:44,262
Given all that,

251
00:15:45,349 --> 00:15:47,306
we can file a lawsuit
to annul the marriage.

252
00:15:50,750 --> 00:15:52,000
What should I do now?

253
00:15:52,083 --> 00:15:55,250
First, now that you know
the marriage has been registered,

254
00:15:55,375 --> 00:15:57,829
continuing your relationship
with the other party is risky.

255
00:15:58,333 --> 00:16:00,185
If you do, it could be taken...

256
00:16:00,186 --> 00:16:02,750
as consent to the marriage,
even if you never agreed to it.

257
00:16:03,125 --> 00:16:04,333
You must keep your distance.

258
00:16:04,416 --> 00:16:06,958
Understood. No need to worry about that.

259
00:16:07,083 --> 00:16:09,708
How long will the lawsuit take?

260
00:16:09,958 --> 00:16:14,458
Let's file the petition first.
Then we'll decide based on their response.

261
00:16:16,519 --> 00:16:18,987
I've reviewed all the necessary documents,

262
00:16:19,056 --> 00:16:20,810
so I'll proceed and contact you again.

263
00:16:21,750 --> 00:16:22,791
Okay.

264
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:36,607
Yeong Ju, you're still here?

265
00:16:37,500 --> 00:16:39,416
Where have you been?

266
00:16:39,791 --> 00:16:41,916
How could I leave? I was too worried.

267
00:16:43,125 --> 00:16:45,889
Come on, Yeong Ju. Where would I even go?

268
00:16:46,250 --> 00:16:49,125
I went and beat up that punk, Im Ji Hu.

269
00:16:49,208 --> 00:16:52,462
- What?
- I was beating him up, and his mom came.

270
00:16:53,044 --> 00:16:56,791
She got to see for herself just how
desperately her son clings to Ji Ni.

271
00:16:56,916 --> 00:16:58,625
She saw it with her own eyes.

272
00:16:58,666 --> 00:17:01,250
What's wrong with you?
He might be your son-in-law someday.

273
00:17:01,458 --> 00:17:03,166
You never know how things will turn out.

274
00:17:03,208 --> 00:17:04,748
Son-in-law, my foot!

275
00:17:04,750 --> 00:17:07,250
How could I become in-laws
with that woman?

276
00:17:08,250 --> 00:17:11,069
What's wrong with you?
Don't you understand how I feel?

277
00:17:12,250 --> 00:17:15,017
I understand your feelings
and your worries all too well.

278
00:17:15,083 --> 00:17:19,050
Yes, Do Hee scares me too. I was shocked
when I heard about the marriage.

279
00:17:19,501 --> 00:17:22,043
But we can't let her scare us too.

280
00:17:22,250 --> 00:17:26,166
Ji Hu is doing the right thing.
We should help him set things right.

281
00:17:26,541 --> 00:17:29,403
Yeong Ju, from Ji Hu's parents'
point of view,

282
00:17:29,404 --> 00:17:32,500
Ji Ni is the biggest problem of all.

283
00:17:32,672 --> 00:17:34,880
That's how the world works. You know that.

284
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:37,230
You're confusing our situation
with theirs.

285
00:17:37,375 --> 00:17:40,416
Ji Hu and Do Hee were never engaged
or married.

286
00:17:40,666 --> 00:17:43,146
Do Hee is the one
making ridiculous claims.

287
00:17:43,916 --> 00:17:45,791
You're not acting like yourself.
What's gotten into you?

288
00:17:46,080 --> 00:17:48,289
You're the one who should
protect Ji Ni the most,

289
00:17:48,291 --> 00:17:51,083
and you're the one
who should stand up to Do Hee.

290
00:17:51,566 --> 00:17:53,941
Forget it. I don't want to talk to you.

291
00:17:54,938 --> 00:17:55,980
Just go, Yeong Ju.

292
00:18:06,458 --> 00:18:08,614
You said you were taking lunch to Ji Hu.

293
00:18:09,500 --> 00:18:10,854
Why is your face so red?

294
00:18:11,541 --> 00:18:12,583
Don't even ask.

295
00:18:13,290 --> 00:18:14,609
When I got there,

296
00:18:15,925 --> 00:18:19,248
Na Ji Ni's mom had Ji Hu
down on his knees.

297
00:18:19,250 --> 00:18:21,660
- What?
- It's all part of her scheme.

298
00:18:21,750 --> 00:18:26,625
She said he couldn't be with Ji Ni
unless he sorted out the paperwork.

299
00:18:26,708 --> 00:18:30,000
It's a calculated move to get him divorced
and pair him with her daughter.

300
00:18:30,166 --> 00:18:31,287
Do you think I don't see that?

301
00:18:31,289 --> 00:18:34,414
But that fool fell for it and just kept...

302
00:18:34,416 --> 00:18:38,875
begging and promising he'd fix everything.
How am I supposed to stay calm?

303
00:18:40,166 --> 00:18:41,708
We need to send him to England right away.

304
00:18:41,791 --> 00:18:44,458
That's right. Ji Hu has changed so much.

305
00:18:45,455 --> 00:18:48,164
Suddenly, he says
I've never taken care of him.

306
00:18:48,166 --> 00:18:50,791
He's complaining about things
he's never mentioned before.

307
00:18:51,213 --> 00:18:54,922
He says Na Ji Ni's mom is different.
He's even comparing us.

308
00:18:55,357 --> 00:18:57,607
It nearly drove me crazy.

309
00:18:57,625 --> 00:18:59,000
Ji Hu said that to you?

310
00:18:59,875 --> 00:19:00,916
Honestly...

311
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:05,362
He's completely bewitched
by that mother and daughter.

312
00:19:05,363 --> 00:19:06,676
We're in real trouble.

313
00:19:12,778 --> 00:19:14,153
Ma'am, Do Hee is here.

314
00:19:14,288 --> 00:19:15,829
How did she know we were here?

315
00:19:25,375 --> 00:19:27,625
Mother.

316
00:19:37,588 --> 00:19:41,422
Na Ji Ni poured water on you from above
while you were in the restroom?

317
00:19:42,583 --> 00:19:43,666
Yes.

318
00:19:46,083 --> 00:19:49,616
Honey, Na Ji Ni is a complete bully.

319
00:19:49,665 --> 00:19:51,248
What are we going to do about Ji Hu?

320
00:19:51,250 --> 00:19:53,500
I can't believe it.
I'm at a loss for words.

321
00:19:54,333 --> 00:19:58,791
Ji Hu and Ji Ni want to sue, saying
our marriage was falsely registered.

322
00:19:59,208 --> 00:20:01,083
How can they do this?

323
00:20:01,666 --> 00:20:04,791
Now that he remembers everything,
he's taking back everything he said.

324
00:20:04,833 --> 00:20:05,875
They're suing?

325
00:20:06,458 --> 00:20:07,875
That's ridiculous.

326
00:20:07,958 --> 00:20:12,291
Honey, I gave them permission
to register the marriage.

327
00:20:12,963 --> 00:20:14,297
That boy...

328
00:20:14,867 --> 00:20:17,284
Ji Hu keeps insisting we have to break up.

329
00:20:18,069 --> 00:20:21,153
Father, am I just a toy to him?

330
00:20:21,666 --> 00:20:25,541
Did he make fools of my parents too?

331
00:20:25,583 --> 00:20:28,083
It's so unfair.
I'm so angry I could lose my mind.

332
00:20:28,125 --> 00:20:29,795
Of course you feel that way.

333
00:20:30,250 --> 00:20:32,458
Look at the state you're in. Goodness.

334
00:20:34,041 --> 00:20:39,333
I was meeting friends
to hand out wedding invitations...

335
00:20:41,309 --> 00:20:42,590
Let me ask you one thing.

336
00:20:42,972 --> 00:20:46,517
Are you sure Ji Hu told you
to register the marriage?

337
00:20:46,750 --> 00:20:48,541
He says he never did.

338
00:20:49,583 --> 00:20:50,999
That's not true.

339
00:20:51,219 --> 00:20:54,625
Ji Hu gave me his ID card
and personal seal himself.

340
00:20:55,916 --> 00:21:00,833
See, Mother? This is what happens
when he keeps going back on his word.

341
00:21:01,916 --> 00:21:05,166
Im Ji Hu, that fool.

342
00:21:05,875 --> 00:21:08,457
Mother, I just want to die.

343
00:21:08,458 --> 00:21:10,625
I don't care. I'm going to kill myself.

344
00:21:13,069 --> 00:21:17,778
Calm down. Don't cry.
There's no need for this.

345
00:21:18,008 --> 00:21:20,799
Ji Hu will marry you, no matter what.

346
00:21:21,463 --> 00:21:24,630
Then I want to move in here.

347
00:21:25,458 --> 00:21:27,388
- Move in here?
- You're going to live here?

348
00:21:28,541 --> 00:21:30,125
My lawyer told me...

349
00:21:30,316 --> 00:21:33,774
to make it clear you've both accepted me
as your daughter-in-law.

350
00:21:49,412 --> 00:21:52,620
Se Ri's doing pretty well for herself.

351
00:21:55,214 --> 00:21:57,548
Hey, Cha Seung Woo. What's on your mind?

352
00:21:59,663 --> 00:22:01,996
Have you ever been in love?

353
00:22:02,666 --> 00:22:04,036
Why bring up love now?

354
00:22:04,625 --> 00:22:07,791
How far have you gone
to keep someone you love?

355
00:22:07,875 --> 00:22:10,113
If you didn't want to lose them,

356
00:22:10,600 --> 00:22:12,374
could you secretly register your marriage?

357
00:22:12,375 --> 00:22:15,131
Are you crazy? That's not love.

358
00:22:17,047 --> 00:22:19,755
Why are you asking? Did something happen?

359
00:22:20,875 --> 00:22:22,125
No, I was just asking.

360
00:22:22,274 --> 00:22:25,067
I thought you and Do Hee
had something going on.

361
00:22:26,015 --> 00:22:27,890
Actually, that's not quite it.

362
00:22:28,331 --> 00:22:32,081
There seemed to be some attraction,
some sympathy. Something like that.

363
00:22:32,083 --> 00:22:34,041
What are you talking about?

364
00:22:34,083 --> 00:22:37,458
You're usually so cold,
yet you visit her and worry about her.

365
00:22:37,625 --> 00:22:39,375
And she calls you "Seung Woo."

366
00:22:39,588 --> 00:22:42,213
It looks to me like you like her too.

367
00:22:42,463 --> 00:22:44,797
Do Do Hee has a husband now.

368
00:22:44,916 --> 00:22:47,448
What? She's married?

369
00:22:47,783 --> 00:22:50,950
They haven't had a wedding,
but they registered their marriage.

370
00:22:51,550 --> 00:22:53,967
I really can't talk to you about anything.

371
00:22:54,204 --> 00:22:55,871
I'll work from home and send the file.

372
00:23:00,416 --> 00:23:01,541
What's with him?

373
00:23:04,708 --> 00:23:06,805
It's been a long day. Go on inside.

374
00:23:08,317 --> 00:23:09,900
Try to comfort your mom.

375
00:23:11,451 --> 00:23:14,534
Comfort her? I don't even want to see her.

376
00:23:14,559 --> 00:23:16,018
We agreed you wouldn't do that.

377
00:23:19,166 --> 00:23:20,416
Okay.

378
00:23:20,875 --> 00:23:22,041
What a good girl.

379
00:23:34,208 --> 00:23:36,583
Didn't like that? I won't do it again.

380
00:23:41,696 --> 00:23:42,738
I'll go now.

381
00:24:03,291 --> 00:24:04,333
Mom.

382
00:24:07,458 --> 00:24:09,208
I went to see Ji Hu today.

383
00:24:10,361 --> 00:24:12,075
I know. I heard.

384
00:24:13,833 --> 00:24:15,072
Why aren't you angry?

385
00:24:17,083 --> 00:24:19,268
Ji Hu told me to comfort you.

386
00:24:19,375 --> 00:24:23,318
He said he understood why you hit him,
and that made him even sadder.

387
00:24:24,041 --> 00:24:25,875
That's the kind of person he is.

388
00:24:26,416 --> 00:24:29,125
Comfort me? As if he cares about me.

389
00:24:29,166 --> 00:24:32,380
Mom, why assume the worst of him?

390
00:24:33,250 --> 00:24:36,583
Do you really love him?

391
00:24:36,666 --> 00:24:38,773
Yes, I love him.

392
00:24:39,458 --> 00:24:41,690
I kept fighting my feelings,
but I finally gave in.

393
00:24:42,416 --> 00:24:46,083
He melted the ice around my heart.
That's how warm he is.

394
00:24:47,166 --> 00:24:50,375
Please give him a chance, Mom.
I'm asking you.

395
00:24:50,416 --> 00:24:51,833
Even with Do Do Hee around?

396
00:24:51,875 --> 00:24:53,899
I'm not scared. I won't run away anymore.

397
00:24:54,458 --> 00:24:58,958
I want a complete, uncomplicated family
with Ji Hu, just like you want for me.

398
00:24:59,130 --> 00:25:00,922
I want that for you too.

399
00:25:01,916 --> 00:25:05,851
When I fell in love,
it hurt that your grandma was against it.

400
00:25:06,375 --> 00:25:08,921
I swore I wouldn't do that to you.

401
00:25:09,694 --> 00:25:11,717
But now I have no choice.

402
00:25:12,625 --> 00:25:15,791
As I was leaving after scolding Ji Hu,
his mom came out.

403
00:25:16,791 --> 00:25:21,375
I can't leave you at the mercy
of that woman and Do Do Hee.

404
00:25:21,500 --> 00:25:23,458
That won't happen. Don't worry.

405
00:25:23,500 --> 00:25:26,916
You think it'll all work out now,
but it might not.

406
00:25:27,083 --> 00:25:28,291
Mom.

407
00:25:29,541 --> 00:25:33,197
Ji Ni, life is unpredictable.

408
00:25:33,500 --> 00:25:36,583
I thought I'd play the cello
for the rest of my life.

409
00:25:37,000 --> 00:25:39,752
I never imagined a life
where I couldn't play.

410
00:25:40,034 --> 00:25:41,909
But now I can't.

411
00:25:42,583 --> 00:25:45,625
You're just taking a break.
Once your wrist heals...

412
00:25:45,708 --> 00:25:46,824
No.

413
00:25:49,916 --> 00:25:50,958
Look.

414
00:25:53,875 --> 00:25:56,173
This is what my life is like now.

415
00:26:04,208 --> 00:26:05,398
Mom.

416
00:26:06,094 --> 00:26:10,177
I thought I'd grow old with your dad...

417
00:26:10,458 --> 00:26:12,833
and play the cello all my life.

418
00:26:13,333 --> 00:26:15,208
But that's not how it turned out.

419
00:26:16,041 --> 00:26:19,085
Let Ji Hu go. You can't handle this.

420
00:26:19,583 --> 00:26:22,833
I've had water thrown on me
in the yard of this house.

421
00:26:23,250 --> 00:26:25,958
Love takes more than just holding on.

422
00:26:26,041 --> 00:26:29,083
You need support from others. Look at me.

423
00:26:29,125 --> 00:26:30,815
My life is proof of that.

424
00:26:31,541 --> 00:26:33,666
Why are you being like this, Mom?

425
00:26:33,708 --> 00:26:37,318
This is your first love.
Do you think I want to act like this?

426
00:26:38,208 --> 00:26:40,982
I had you when everyone else
wanted me to give up on you.

427
00:26:41,041 --> 00:26:43,832
I raised you through so many tears.

428
00:26:44,916 --> 00:26:48,691
I wanted you, at least,
to find happiness in love...

429
00:26:48,892 --> 00:26:50,833
and have a wonderful marriage.

430
00:26:50,916 --> 00:26:52,500
That's all I wished for.

431
00:26:55,125 --> 00:26:56,875
This just isn't right.

432
00:26:57,166 --> 00:27:01,583
I can already see
how much you'll cry and suffer.

433
00:27:02,625 --> 00:27:04,375
Please. I'm begging you.

434
00:27:22,875 --> 00:27:23,916
Yes.

435
00:27:25,375 --> 00:27:26,458
Now?

436
00:27:27,541 --> 00:27:28,741
Okay.

437
00:27:39,375 --> 00:27:41,166
Why didn't you come inside?

438
00:27:42,291 --> 00:27:44,011
That would only cause another scene.

439
00:27:44,526 --> 00:27:45,944
The General wants to see you.

440
00:27:45,958 --> 00:27:47,192
Let's go quietly for a moment.

441
00:27:47,541 --> 00:27:49,541
I'll get something to put on.

442
00:28:43,083 --> 00:28:46,375
(Family Register)

443
00:28:46,416 --> 00:28:47,915
Leave Ji Hu. If you keep this up...

444
00:28:47,916 --> 00:28:49,124
You'll just be his mistress.

445
00:28:49,125 --> 00:28:50,915
Doesn't your mom's life scare you?

446
00:28:50,916 --> 00:28:52,915
You're supposed to protect me.
How can you both do this?

447
00:28:52,916 --> 00:28:54,415
You brat! After all we've done for you...

448
00:28:54,416 --> 00:28:56,541
Then who is my family?
I know you adopted me.

449
00:28:56,583 --> 00:28:57,791
I'm sorry, Mom.

450
00:28:57,842 --> 00:29:00,259
How can I be a good mom?

451
00:29:00,291 --> 00:29:02,791
But what if I end up like my mom?

452
00:29:02,833 --> 00:29:04,500
Are you going to break up?

453
00:29:04,541 --> 00:29:06,083
You're not going to leave me, right?

454
00:29:07,076 --> 00:29:09,076
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
